(503, 'The distance is: (3D) %f (2D) %f - (3D, point-to-point) %f yards.', '거리는: (3D) %f (2D) %f - (3D, point-to-point) %f 야드입니다.', 'La distance est : (3D) %f (2D) %f - (3D, point à point) %f yards.', 'Die Entfernung beträgt: (3D) %f (2D) %f - (3D, Punkt-zu-Punkt) %f Yards.', '距离为：(3D) %f (2D) %f - (3D, point-to-point) %f 码。', NULL, 'La distancia es: (3D) %f (2D) %f - (3D, punto a punto) %f yardas.', NULL, 'Расстояние составляет: (3D) %f (2D) %f - (3D, точка-точка) %f ярдов.'),
