(2666, 'All for naught, it would seem..$b$bMoments later the priestess is swarmed by the corpses of the peasants that were surrounding her....$b$bThe fallen have risen.', 0),
(2671, 'Simone the Seductress:$B$BYou will find Simone befouling Un''Goro Crater. Do not be fooled by her disguise. Approach her with caution and challenge her to battle.', 2672) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

